* Mixed devices: touchscreen selection followed by physical dial adjustment.
Goal: Enter a vehicle destination
. Goal: Open navigation
.. Look at <navigation button>
.. Touch <navigation button>
. Goal: Enter address
.. Hands to keyboard
.. Type <destination address>
.. Verify <destination address> is displayed
. Goal: Select suggested destination
.. Hands to touchscreen
.. Look at <destination suggestion>
.. Touch <destination suggestion>
. Goal: Set guidance volume
.. Hands to volume dial
.. Look at <volume dial>
.. Turn <volume dial>
.. Verify guidance volume is set
